---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Separator from "../components/Separator.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Posts from "../components/Posts.astro";
---

<Layout title="manni/about" path="about me :3">
    <div class="content">
        <div class="aboutmediv">
            <p>
                Haii im manni (they/them), a 14yo hacker. I like to make silly
                and useful projects, check them <a href="/projects">here</a>.
                I'm also homeschooled, I read a lot, I draw and talk a lot in
                the <a href="https://hackclub.com/">hack club slack</a>. I'm
                trying to write more too, go check them out <a href="blog/"
                    >here</a
                >. I really like Minecraft, PCBs, Kicad, Godot, Aseprite and
                Celeste!! :3c
                <br />
            </p>
            <p>
                I also watch a bit too many Minecraft videos and spend way too
                much time in YouTube. I procrastinate a lot, never finish
                projects, make too many games, and always end up with another
                idea for a new one. I like burple.
            </p>
        </div>
        <Header title="Read my posts!!" />
        <div class="posts">
            <Posts limit={3} />
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .aboutmediv,
    .posts {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 20px;
    }
</style>
